<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P33i è stata usata da"@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di P33 used specific technique: in DeSMòS collega una costrizione letteraria agli eventi di creazione dell'espressione in cui è stata impiegata. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E29_Design_or_Procedure e come range crm:E7_Activity. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint e come range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P33i was used by"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of P33 used specific technique: in DeSMòS, it relates a literary constraint to the expression creation events in which it was employed. The original property has domain crm:E29_Design_or_Procedure and range crm:E7_Activity. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E29_Design_or_Procedure> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
